n S$ and ${x}_{min}\\le x$ for all $x\\in S.$\n\nFirst, recall that, by definition, ${R}_{0}^{-}=(-\\infty ,0].$\n\nThis set has $\\text{no minimum},$ while \n\n$$\nmax(A)=max({R}_{0}^{-})=max(-\\infty ,0]=0.\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :question/answer-fields ["answer-field-f2b32247-1da0-5476-8f92-1c3ff937c2ec" "answer-field-59fbeaf4-1e54-5e93-87c0-e9ae1f0701cc" "answer-field-3ea78180-0fde-56dc-91ec-da9439574c93"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id "answer-field-f2b32247-1da0-5476-8f92-1c3ff937c2ec" :answer-field/id #uuid "f2b32247-1da0-5476-8f92-1c3ff937c2ec" :answer-field/key "field-1" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/select :answer-field/correct "answer-17e03875-19f4-5839-86f0-459f64514f3b" :answer-field/choices ["answer-0185113e-67ca-5fea-8414-80405b6d2c88" "answer-17e03875-19f4-5839-86f0-459f64514f3b"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "answer-0185113e-67ca-5fea-8414-80405b6d2c88" :answer/id #uuid "0185113e-67ca-5fea-8414-80405b6d2c88" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "maximum" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-17e03875-19f4-5839-86f0-459f64514f3b" :answer/id #uuid "17e03875-19f4-5839-86f0-459f64514f3b" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "minimum" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-field-59fbeaf4-1e54-5e93-87c0-e9ae1f0701cc" :answer-field/id #uuid "59fbeaf4-1e54-5e93-87c0-e9ae1f0701cc" :answer-field/key "field-2" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/select :answer-field/correct "answer-b966bc22-d89b-5ccc-b68e-01f630cd7e71" :answer-field/choices ["answer-b966bc22-d89b-5ccc-b68e-01f630cd7e71" "answer-c06f4cc3-c59f-582b-b122-f00bdde60517"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "answer-b966bc22-d89b-5ccc-b68e-01f630cd7e71" :answer/id #uuid "b966bc22-d89b-5ccc-b68e-01f630cd7e71" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "maximum" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-c06f4cc3-c59f-582b-b122-f00bdde60517" :answer/id #uuid "c06f4cc3-c59f-582b-b122-f00b